              "version": "1.6.4",
              "description": "<h2>SPT Realism Mod v1.6.4 for SPT 3.11</h2>\n<p>Note: please see the “known issues” section at the bottom of this post before reporting issues.</p>\n<h3>Changes:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Added config option for stance SFX volume</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Fixes:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed loud sound effect when transitioning stances</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Known Issues:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Balancing is always on-going.</li>\n<li>Continuous healing is not compatible with the medical system, recommended to disable it.</li>\n<li>Using limb selector to heal (hotkey + scroll) can cause strange animation issues and potentially bugs.</li>\n<li>Glock 18C recoil is bugged, BSG issue.</li>\n<li>High ready sprint animation bugs out sometimes, BSG issue (haven’t seen it happen in 3.11 yet).</li>\n<li>Can hit self with melee in the legs.</li>\n<li>SPT/EFT is cursed.</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/416/spt-realism-mod/1.6.4",
